# The toolchains image. Every container: job of the CI workflow pulls it. A JDK or Gradle bump
# edits ONE line: the tag below.
#
# CI pulls <this tag>-deps-<hash of the build files> (ci/toolchains/image-tag.sh), and builds it when
# it is missing. This tag itself follows develop. A run that cannot build (a fork pull request) takes it.
#
# The name points at Docker Hub. ci/resolve-toolchains-image.sh decides whether a pull takes the mirror.
#
# Bash sources this file. Keep it to one assignment.
TOOLCHAINS_IMAGE=beshultd/ror-ci-toolchains:jdk-8-11-17-21-gradle-9.8.2
